  "title": "XPEL Reports Revenue Growth of 13.1% to $117.4 million, EBITDA Growth of 17.8% to $17.0 million in First Quarter 2026",
  "summary": "XPEL, Inc. (Nasdaq: XPEL) (the \"Company\"), a global provider of protective films and coatings, announced consolidated results 1 for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026. First Quarter 2026 Overview: Revenue increased 13.1% to $117.4 million in the first quarter of 2026 compared to $103.8 million in the first quarter of 2025. Gross margin of 43.7% in the first quarter of 2026 compared to 42.3% in the first quarter last year. Net income attributable to stockholders of the company increased 20.5%",
